---
import { LANGUAGES, SKILLS } from '../../data/profile';
---

<div class="about">
	<div class="bio reveal">
		<p>
			I'm currently in my final year studying Mathematics with Computer Science
			(Double Major) at the National University of Singapore as
			an NUS Merit Scholar, graduating in May 2027. Before that, I spent six years at Temasek
			Junior College, leaving with a perfect 90 rank points, a Distinction in H3 Mathematics and
			two Singapore Mathematical Olympiad medals.
		</p>
		<p>
			I have always enjoyed mathematics. This joy comes from the logical thinking and problem solving process. Many times I have been amazed by the elegance of solutions to difficult problems. This is probably why I LOVE playing strategy games like chess, poker, floating bridge and other board games. 
		</p>
	</div>

	<aside class="toolkit card reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms" aria-labelledby="toolkit-title">
		<h2 id="toolkit-title">Toolkit</h2>

		{
			SKILLS.map((group) => (
				<div class="group">
					<p class="group-name">{group.group}</p>
					<ul class="chips">
						{group.items.map((item) => (
							<li class="chip">{item}</li>
						))}
					</ul>
				</div>
			))
		}

		<div class="group">
			<p class="group-name">Spoken languages</p>
			<ul class="langs">
				{
					LANGUAGES.map((lang) => (
						<li>
							<span>{lang.name}</span>
							<span class="level">{lang.level}</span>
						</li>
					))
				}
			</ul>
		</div>
	</aside>
</div>

<style>
	.about {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
		align-items: start;
		gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.bio {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.1rem;
		max-width: 38rem;
		color: var(--text);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.toolkit {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.35rem;
		padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
	}

	.toolkit h2 {
		font-size: var(--step-1);
	}

	.group {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	.group + .group {
		padding-block-start: 1.25rem;
		border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
	}

	.group-name {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: var(--step--2);
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.langs {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		font-size: var(--step--1);
	}

	.langs li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		color: var(--ink);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.level {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	@media (max-width: 56rem) {
		.about {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
